= General =

=== Is it free? ===

Yes, **GPL** licensed. See ``COPYING``.

=== Which formats are supported? ===

HTML, XHTML, SGML, LaTeX, Lout, Man, MoinMoin, MagicPoint and plain text.

= Troubleshooting =

=== The table is broken ===

Every row must start with a ``|``, and a title row with ``||``:

```
|| Name  | Age |
|  Alice |  30 |
|  Bob   |  25 |
```

